  "id": "linguine-with-broccoli-and-red-peppers",
  "name": "Linguine with Broccoli and Red Peppers",
  "subtitle": "A colorful pasta side with tender vegetables and Parmesan.",
  "description": "Linguine is tossed with microwaved broccoli, sautéed garlic, sweet red pepper, butter, olive oil, and Parmesan for a quick vegetable-forward side.",
  "meal_type": "side",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "yield": {
